  "finding": "The selected primitive-register writes only affect byte3 and follow draw. Citro3D emits the same pair for post-vertex-cache clearing; they do not establish primitive bits8-9.",
  "reference_draw_setup": "Citro3D sets primitive mode before draw with mask2. Its indexed triangle path uses geometry primitive mode and geometry-stage configuration, so raw post-draw parameter0 is not a topology oracle.",
  "conclusion": "Retain explicit triangle-list interpretation for OBJ inspection; recover original pre-draw primitive/geometry-stage state before claiming original topology.",
  "limits": "Primary external implementation clarifies command intent but is not original Pokemon executable evidence."
